meta {
  name: Get All Wash
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/wash
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Wash

  This request is used to get all wash history, you can filter the wash data using given `search` to find based on wash_address or wash_desc. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes, and a pagination.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Wash fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "wash fetched",
    "data": {
      "current_page": 1,
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "ab8b8d0e-d74d-11ed-afa1-0242ac120002",
          "vehicle_name": "Honda - Brio RS MT",
          "vehicle_plate_number": "D 1610 ZRB",
          "wash_desc": "Cuci mobil",
          "wash_by": "Carwash",
          "is_wash_body": 1,
          "is_wash_window": 1,
          "is_wash_dashboard": 1,
          "is_wash_tires": 1,
          "is_wash_trash": 1,
          "is_wash_engine": 1,
          "is_wash_seat": 1,
          "is_wash_carpet": 1,
          "is_wash_pillows": 0,
          "wash_address": "AutoService Jl. Kapten Tandean",
          "wash_start_time": "2024-02-29 21:30:00",
          "wash_end_time": "2024-02-29 22:20:00",
          "is_fill_window_washing_water": 0,
          "is_wash_hollow": 1,
          "created_at": "2024-03-27 12:33:05",
          "updated_at": null
        }
      ],
      "last_page": 1,
      "per_page": 14,
      "total": 1
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — wash failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "wash history not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}